# § T · App Task Template (16 items, verbatim)

Use for non-bug, non-feature work: refactor, metadata-only update (label / description / public flag), UX adjustment to existing fields, deprecation, cleanup, version bump, branding tweak. Universal rules and Common Pre/Post blocks are defined in `make-app-todo-rules.mdc`.

| # | id | content |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | `common_runtime_path_check` | (Common Pre — verbatim from `make-app-todo-rules.mdc`.) |
| 2 | `common_context_load` | (Common Pre — verbatim.) |
| 3 | `common_code_sync` | (Common Pre — verbatim.) |
| 4 | `common_jira_fetch` | (Common Pre — verbatim.) |
| 5 | `common_attachments` | (Common Pre — verbatim.) |
| 6 | `task_references_reread` | Re-read the relevant references (`app-ux-best-practices.md` for any UX change; `parameters-reference.md` for any expect/parameters/interface change; `runtime-reference.md` + `communication-reference.md` for `api.imljson` change). |
| 7 | `task_plan` | [GATE] State exactly what will change (file list, component list, before/after for each metadata field) and wait for explicit user approval before editing. |
| 8 | `task_implement` | Apply the code / metadata edits in a single pass. No piecemeal fixes. |
| 9 | `task_test_function` | (if any `functions/*/code.js` edited) Update `test.js` + run `test-function.js`. Cancel only when no `code.js` was touched. |
| 10 | `task_test_component` | (if any `api.imljson` edited) Run `test-component.js` for each changed component. Cancel only when no `api.imljson` was touched. |
| 11 | `task_upload` | [GATE] Show summary of changes, get user confirmation, then run the matching write script (`update-app.js` / `update-component.js` / `delete-component.js`). |
| 12 | `task_dev_notes` | Ask the user: "Shall I write Developer Notes to the Jira ticket?" Cancel only when `common_jira_fetch` was cancelled, or when the change is metadata-only with no implementation detail worth recording. |
| 13 | `common_context_update` | (Common Post — verbatim.) |
| 14 | `common_upsert_app_context` | (Common Post — verbatim.) |
| 15 | `common_upsert_jira_ticket` | (Common Post — verbatim.) |
| 16 | `common_compaction_recommend` | (Common Post — verbatim.) |
